# No em dash

Never use Unicode em dash U+2014, and never write the JSON/text unicode escape for U+2014 in JSON or other text.

Use ASCII hyphen-minus `-` or en dash U+2013 only.

Applies to copy, docs, configs, commits, PR text, and all future edits in this repo.
Pre-commit rejects staged files that contain either form.
